    {
      "id": "p0140-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "All of this teamwork resulted in a Japanese phrase with the same number of characters as the English phrase, hitboxes that closely match the original game’s hitboxes, and all-new bone graphics that look just like the original English bone graphics. Even more impressive is that all of this work was done for one short message that stays on the screen for less than five seconds!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.291411,
          0.814286,
          0.908998,
          0.905714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2906785455298871,
          0.815,
          0.9150233088159122,
          0.9042857142857142
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "经过这番协作，最终的日文短语与英文拥有相同的字符数，碰撞判定框也与原版十分接近；全新制作的骨头字图像，看起来仍与原英文版本风格一致。更令人佩服的是，这一切工作，只是为了屏幕上一句停留不到五秒钟的短语！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
